18:["$","p",null,{"children":["The ",["$","code",null,{"children":"namespace: forge"}]," setting on the collector's Prometheus exporter is\nwhat produces every metric name you have ever seen in a Forge dashboard.\nSend the OTLP stream anywhere else (another collector without that setting,\nan OTLP-native backend, or the shipped collector's own ",["$","code",null,{"children":"otlphttp/prometheus"}],"\npipeline into Prometheus's receiver) and the names change:"]}]
