20:["$","p",null,{"children":["With ",["$","code",null,{"children":"cache_metrics"}]," absent, Forge constructs the same store graph without\na wrapper, a timer, an attribute allocation or an OpenTelemetry call on the hot\npath. The feature costs nothing when it is off, which is why it is off."]}]
21:["$","p",null,{"children":["Wrap the stores you actually want to measure, usually ",["$","code",null,{"children":"CAS_MAIN_STORE"}]," and the\nAC. Wrapping every layer of a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"fast_slow"}]," composition gives you one series per\nlayer and a hit-rate query that no longer means what you think it means."]}]
