41:["$","p",null,{"children":["The repository ships 34 more as recording rules in\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"prometheus-recording-rules.yml"}],", grouped into ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_execution"}],",\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_cache"}],", ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_performance"}]," and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_slo"}],". Loading that\nfile gives you ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge:execution_queue_time_p95"}]," and friends as\npre-computed series. The shipped dashboard does not query them; its panels\nread the raw ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_execution_*"}]," series directly."]}]
