43:["$","p",null,{"children":["A reference dashboard lives at\n",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/toxicwind/forge/blob/v1.6.5/deployment-examples/metrics/grafana/dashboards/forge-overview.json","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","data-source-link":"deployment-examples/metrics/grafana/dashboards/forge-overview.json","data-source-ref":"v1.6.5","title":"deployment-examples/metrics/grafana/dashboards/forge-overview.json at v1.6.5","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground no-underline transition-colors hover:border-brand/50 hover:text-brand","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"12","height":"12","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6"}]}],"forge-overview.json"]}],".\nThe Compose stack provisions it automatically. Elsewhere: Dashboards → New →\nImport, paste the JSON, pick your Prometheus data source. It draws execution\nthroughput, success rate, active actions by stage and stage transitions from\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_execution_*"}],"; it has no cache, worker or gRPC panels."]}]
44:["$","p",null,{"children":["If you add panels bound to ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_cache_size"}]," or\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_cache_entries"}],", they will be empty forever. That is the metric,\nnot your pipeline."]}]
