81:["$","p",null,{"children":["On the scrape path, the collector's Prometheus exporter has\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"resource_to_telemetry_conversion"}]," enabled, so every resource attribute,\nincluding anything you set in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES"}],", becomes a label\n(",["$","code",null,{"children":"deployment_environment"}],", ",["$","code",null,{"children":"k8s_cluster_name"}],", ",["$","code",null,{"children":"service_instance_id"}],").\nThe ",["$","code",null,{"children":"promote_resource_attributes"}]," list in the shipped Prometheus config\n(",["$","code",null,{"children":"k8s.pod.name"}],", ",["$","code",null,{"children":"k8s.namespace.name"}],", ",["$","code",null,{"children":"k8s.deployment.name"}]," and a dozen\nmore) only governs the collector's second pipeline into Prometheus's own\nOTLP receiver; on that path attributes not on the list do not become\nlabels on the series (they survive only on ",["$","code",null,{"children":"target_info"}],")."]}]
